994
00:34:33,051 --> 00:34:33,852
Where are you going?

995
00:34:54,571 --> 00:34:56,131
(Test Results & Item Details)
The latest test data for Jinghua

996
00:34:56,131 --> 00:34:56,892
(Pass & Fail)
is all right here.

997
00:34:57,332 --> 00:34:58,211
(Fail)
As you can see,

998
00:34:58,211 --> 00:34:59,372
several indicators failed.

999
00:35:00,131 --> 00:35:01,012
Mr. Lin admitted

1000
00:35:01,012 --> 00:35:02,251
that he let greed blind him,

1001
00:35:02,772 --> 00:35:04,812
cutting corners during production

1002
00:35:04,852 --> 00:35:05,651
for personal gain,

1003
00:35:06,091 --> 00:35:07,292
