1066
00:37:16,571 --> 00:37:17,812
These were rewards

1067
00:37:17,852 --> 00:37:19,892
given to me by the company

1068
00:37:20,051 --> 00:37:21,492
for commercializing my research!

1069
00:37:21,772 --> 00:37:23,731
They were clearly the kickbacks
we agreed on,

1070
00:37:23,772 --> 00:37:24,292
