1100
00:38:11,051 --> 00:38:12,492
I know I won't get away

1101
00:38:13,051 --> 00:38:13,731
with this.

1102
00:38:13,812 --> 00:38:15,292
That's why I confessed to Mr. Di

1103
00:38:15,571 --> 00:38:16,691
before the meeting,

1104
00:38:16,731 --> 00:38:18,211
hoping for a chance

1105
00:38:18,452 --> 00:38:19,691
to mend my ways.

1106
00:38:23,772 --> 00:38:25,731
Here are my personal bank statements.

1107
00:38:26,292 --> 00:38:28,772
(Jiangzhou Bank Transaction Details)
The kickback transfers to Ms. Zhang

1108
00:38:29,531 --> 00:38:30,051
