will be put under Meng's charge.

1146
00:40:07,012 --> 00:40:07,592
(General Manager Yu Meng)

1147
00:40:07,932 --> 00:40:09,412
There's no money left in our account.

1148
00:40:09,452 --> 00:40:11,211
We can't pay the manufacturer's deposit.

1149
00:40:11,211 --> 00:40:12,171
We're out of money?

1150
00:40:12,731 --> 00:40:13,571
Mr. Di, your wife

1151
00:40:13,651 --> 00:40:14,852
